━━━ stdout
Show repository and platform information

Usage: opentide info [OPTIONS] [section] [name]

Arguments:
  [section]
          

  [name]
          Vocabulary to inspect, with the vocab section (e.g. surface)

Options:
      --platform <PLATFORM>
          Detection platform: sentinel, microsoft_defender, splunk, sentinel_one, crowdstrike, harfanglab, carbon_black_cloud, elastic, sysdig, bitdefender, graylog, exabeam, google_secops
          
          [possible values: sentinel, microsoft_defender, splunk, sentinel_one, crowdstrike, harfanglab, carbon_black_cloud, elastic, sysdig, bitdefender, graylog, exabeam, google_secops]

      --technique <TECHNIQUE>
          ATT&CK technique ID for the coverage section (T1059)

      --strict
          Exit non-zero when any object failed to load

      --help
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide info
  $ opentide info --platform sentinel

━━━ stderr · empty
